# Glyphfall: a valley somebody wrote down, drawn in letters. Somebody typing slowly, and thinking between
# the words: short dry marimba notes in little runs, like keys, with gaps; a koto answering now and then like
# the bell at the end of a line; a quiet pad under it. E dorian, 84 bpm.

title Glyphfall
tempo 84
beats 4
steps 2
seed  159

voice pad   kind=pad       octave=4  gain=0.34  reverb=0.6
voice bass  kind=bass      octave=2  gain=0.22  reverb=0.2
voice keys  kind=marimba   octave=4  gain=0.34  pan=-0.2  reverb=0.3
voice bell  kind=koto      octave=5  gain=0.26  pan=0.25  reverb=0.55

